{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13216190","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13216190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1321619001:0":{"text":"어라? 데미는요? 어째서 사라진 거지?","source_cn":"咦？德米呢？怎么不见了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE63D2D856BA24949","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1321619002:0":{"text":"어쩌면 가족의 곁으로 돌아왔기 때문에 집념이 사라진 걸지도 몰라...","source_cn":"大概是因为他终于回到了家人身边，所以执念消散了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9FD20AE5B4F5260","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321619003:0":{"text":"이 앰버 후르츠를 묘비 앞에 둬요. 데미와 크세니아 아주머니를 기리기 위해.","source_cn":"我们把这些雾澄果放在墓碑前吧，当做对德米和克谢尼娅大婶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA216CA4DDB69237","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}